# Only api/Dockerfile.render (Render) builds from the repo root; the jury and web images use ./api and ./web.
# Allowlist: the build context gets exactly what that image copies — hackathon data (data/train.json, gold
# files) must not leave the hackathon, and the OSM extract / node_modules would only slow the build.
*
!api/requirements.txt
!api/requirements-render.txt
!api/jana_address
!api/artifacts
!eval/__init__.py
!eval/ab.py
!eval/metric.py
!eval/llm_verify.py
!training/__init__.py
!training/label_llm.py
!training/validate_labels.py
!training/prompts/label_system.md
!data/conventions_examples.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
